FL Stream Browser VST v1.0.0

Build Date: September 27, 2025
Git Commit: d27b1dc

Features:
- General Web Browser with navigation controls
- FL Stream Voice Chat integration (voice.latticeworks-ai.com)
- Real-time Colyseus WebSocket voice collaboration  
- Push-to-talk parameter automation
- VST3, AU, and Standalone formats

Tested Platforms:
- macOS 10.15+ (Catalina and later)
- FL Studio 21+, Logic Pro X, Ableton Live

Dependencies:
- JUCE 7.0.12
- OpenSSL 1.1+
- Opus Codec
- libwebm
- Boost System

Build Configuration:
- C++17 Standard
- Release build with optimizations
- SSL/TLS support enabled
- WebBrowser component enabled